ug":"fleuve-noir-2018-1-1","name":"Black Tide","summary":"The disappearance of a boy sends an alcoholic cop (Vincent Cassel) on the track of a suspicious teacher (Romain Duris).","description":"Dany, the Arnault family’s teenage son has disappeared. The case is assigned to François Visconti (Vincent Cassel), a world-weary and disillusioned detective whose wife has just left him. The policeman investigates to find the missing teenager while he is reluctant to take care of his own son, Denis, 16, who seems to be mixed up in drug trafficking. When Mr. Bellaile (Romain Duris), Dany’s French tutor, learns about his former student’s disappearance, he offers his services to the detective.","duration":7980000,"originalContentDuration":6795000,"allotment":7980,"rating":"14+","featuredImage":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6a9add68e92f4736336ccb02/screenshot16_9_1788534121710.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"genre":"Thriller","type":"movie","seasonsNumbers":[],"stitched":{"path":"/stitch/hls/episode/6a9add68e92f4736336ccb02/master.m3u8"},"covers":[{"aspectRatio":"347:500","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6a9add68e92f4736336ccb02/poster_1788534121710.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=1000&q=75&w=694"},{"aspectRatio":"4:3","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6a9add68e92f4736336ccb02/screenshot4_3_1788534121710.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=480&q=75&w=640"},{"aspectRatio":"16:9","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6a9add68e92f4736336ccb02/screenshot16_9_1788534121710.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"}],"categories":[{"id":"64bff2ca24ade50008ba08a3"}],"poster16_9":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6a9add68e92f4736336ccb02/poster16_9_1788534121710.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"clip":{"actors":["Vincent Cassel","Romain Duris","Sandrine Kiberlain"],"directors":["Erick Zonca"],"originalReleaseDate":"2018-08-03T00:00:00Z"},"avail":{},"stream_url":"https://cfd-v4-service-channel-stitcher-use1-1.prd.plut