ysicist with dreams of sending his fellow citizens into space, and the object of Alice’s affection. Joseph and Alice appear to lead the perfect life until their bliss is ripped apart by the civil war and nothing will be the same again.","duration":6360000,"originalContentDuration":5430000,"allotment":6360,"rating":"14+","featuredImage":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6a9b0bd37a5624e68db376f9/screenshot16_9_1788546009799.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"genre":"Drama","type":"movie","seasonsNumbers":[],"stitched":{"path":"/stitch/hls/episode/6a9b0bd37a5624e68db376f9/master.m3u8"},"covers":[{"aspectRatio":"347:500","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6a9b0bd37a5624e68db376f9/poster_1788546009799.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=1000&q=75&w=694"},{"aspectRatio":"4:3","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6a9b0bd37a5624e68db376f9/screenshot4_3_1788546009799.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=480&q=75&w=640"},{"aspectRatio":"16:9","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6a9b0bd37a5624e68db376f9/screenshot16_9_1788546009799.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"}],"categories":[{"id":"64bff2ca24ade50008ba08a3"}],"poster16_9":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6a9b0bd37a5624e68db376f9/poster16_9_1788546009799.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"clip":{"actors":["Alba Rohrwacher","Wajdi Mouawad","Isabelle Zighondi"],"directors":["Chloé Mazlo"],"originalReleaseDate":"2021-11-05T00:00:00Z"},"avail":{},"stream_url":"https://cfd-v4-service-channel-stitcher-use1-1.prd.pluto.tv/v2/stitch/hls/episode/6a9b0bd37a5624e68db376f9/master.m3u8?advertisingId=&appName=web&appVersion=7.9.0-a9cca6b89aea4dc0998b92a51989d2adb9a9025d&app_name=web&clientDeviceType=0&clientID=688e2fcf-3b1e-4478-a146-7d2b26ed9b90&clientModelNumber=1.0.0&country=CA&deviceDNT=false&deviceId=688e2fcf-3b1e-4478-a146-7d2b26ed9b90&deviceLat=45.4200&deviceLon=-75.7000&deviceMake=Chrome&deviceModel=web&deviceType=web&deviceVersion=16.2.0&marketingRegion=CA&serverSideAds=true&sessionID=1dc69d49-d503-11f1-b416-2600f46c7587&sid=1dc69d49-d503-11f1-b416-2600f46c7587&userId=&jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IjU3MGE4NTE5LTNhNzEtNGQ1Ni1iMTAyLTIwN2Q4MjI4MTZkYiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..ZyRJBnhBFXVu4SlUFHPffnv0QscQ36uK74DGRsIBotM&masterJWTPassthrough=true"},"6a9b153028c873c7c4c47e9b-ca":{"_id":"6a9b153028c873c7c4c47e9b","seriesID":"6a9b153028c873c7c4c47e7e","slug":"un-peuple-et-son-roi-2019-1-1","name":"One Nation, One King","summary":"Set in France from 1789 to 1793, revolutionary men and the country’s political figures are called upon to discuss the fate of the fallen King and the advent of the French Republic.","description":"Paris, 1789. The Bastille has been stormed and a breath of liberty blows through the streets of Paris. Françoise, a young washerwoman, and Basile, a drifter without a family or name, discover the unique exhilaration of love and revolution. Together with their friends and the people of the working-class districts of Paris, they begin to realize dreams of emancipation in a newly formed assembly where they witness, with both hopes and doubts, the creation of a new political system. Within their debates and the fury on the streets, lies the fate of their once sacred king and the birth of a republic._x000D_\nFreedom has a story.","duration":8640000,"originalContentDuration":7335000,"allotment":8640,"rating":"14+","featuredImage":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6a9b153028c873c7c4c47e9b/screenshot16_9_1788548403674.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"genre":"Drama","type":"movie","seasonsNumbers":[],"stitched":{"path":"/stitch/hls/episode/6a9b153028c873c7c4c47e9b/master.m3u8"},"covers":[{"aspectRatio":"347:500","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6a9b153028c873c7c4c47e9b/poster_1788548403674.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=1000&q=75&w=694"},{"aspectRatio":"4:3","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6a9b153028c873c7c4c47e9b/screenshot4_3_1788548403674.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=480&q=75&w=64